%% Creazione dalla centrale; dal bot vedi chat_notifications_sequence.mmd.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Centrale as Client RESPONSABILE
    participant API as MissionController
    participant Service as MissionService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Auto as AutoAssignmentService
    Centrale->>API: POST /api/v1/missioni
    API->>Service: validate DTO and role
    Service->>DB: validate customer/intervention, insert mission nuova
    DB-->>Service: mission id and code
    Service-->>API: response DTO
    API-->>Centrale: 201 Created
    Service-)Auto: dopo il commit, chiede la proposta automatica
